// A trailing comma on a suggestion trims.
// A bang stays. The ranker is unchanged.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE comma ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG comma law

IMPULSE comma 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "comma" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
